/-! # 0509: rigorous enclosure of `Tp(n,k)`

If the coarse ball `(c, r)` (scale `2^128`) encloses `TS n 82 gq k (n+k+1)`, then with
`σ = ½(1+(−1)^{n+k})`, `Cd = g0 − log L − (log 2 − 1)`:
`|Tp n k − ([n=k]·Cd − L c_n c_k σ c/2^128)| ≤ L c_n c_k σ (r/2^128 + 2·10⁻³²) + 2·10⁻²⁴·L`.
 -/

